<title>USA: Tseng Labs to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Tseng Labs to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Pa. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tseng Labs Inc said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares over the next 24 months.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be financed with available cash, the company said.</p>
<p>As of September 30 Tseng had 19,047,338 common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
